# This kit is copied to a Linux box and run there. The repo is checked out on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite these files to CRLF and
# leave the shell script with a "bad interpreter" error and the unit file with
# stray carriage returns in its values. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
